their proper congratulations

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:01.160
for what they've done,
so, so it'll all be,

00:23:01.160 --> 00:23:02.180
it'll all be good at the end.

00:23:02.180 --> 00:23:04.260
So I wouldn't worry about it too much.

00:23:04.260 --> 00:23:06.070
Take care of yourself more than anything,

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:08.550
and I think it'll all, it'll all work out.

00:23:08.550 --> 00:23:11.240
So let's see other questions here.

